            "review_title": "Review at The Mug Cofee",
            "review_text": "nununununu\nLyon, France79 contributions\n0\nSplendid Location !\nAug 2016 • Friends\nJust a simple coffee place like there are millions in Vietnam, with good coffee, cheap prices & friendly staff. But the best of it is the location, the terrace in front of the less known Truc Bach Lake, near the Tay Ho lake. This place is so peaceful, relax, which is rare & precious compare to the sometimes frantic Hanoi. If the weather is good, you'd like to stay there for hours, watching time passing by...\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 18, 2016",
